[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2606040000-session-close-nusa-ritual-hemp-actor", :adr/title "ADR-2606040000: Session close — nusa (幣) ritual/industrial hemp heritage actor + cannabis-policy neutral extensions", :adr/status "active", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/body "\n# ADR-2606040000: Session close — nusa (幣) ritual/industrial hemp heritage actor + cannabis-policy neutral extensions\n\n**Status**: active\n**Date**: 2026-06-04\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n# Context\n\nDocumentation-only session-close for the work answering *「日本国内での大麻の解禁についての project / actor は設計されているか」* (answer at the time: **none** — a full search found no actor/ADR/lexicon/cell subject to cannabis / 大麻 / THC). In discussion the user grounded the question in Japan's hemp (麻) heritage — Shinto purification (注連縄/祓串/大幣), the imperial accession 麁服 (aratae) and the 阿波忌部 lineage — and asked to pursue the two charter-clean lines, **not** recreational-legalization advocacy. **Authoritative design = ADR-2606039800.** This record only captures what shipped and what did not.\n\n# Decision\n\nRecord the session outcome. No new design decisions; ADR-2606039800 is authoritative.\n\n## Shipped\n\n- **New Tier-B actor `orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-nusa/` (幣)** — DID `did:web:etzhayyim.com:actor:nusa`, R0. Heritage knowledge graph (`:rite/* :imbe/* :hemp/*`, as-of history) + low-THC 栽培者免許 cultivation-revival design. Manifests (`manifest.edn` / `manifest.jsonld`), README, CLAUDE.md, `kotoba/{schema,seed}.edn`.\n- **G1 invariant in three places** — `:thc-class ∈ {:fiber,:low-thc}`; `:psychoactive` is **not representable** in the ontology schema, the lexicon `const`, or the code (`fiber_provenance` raises `ValueError`; `analyze.py` `screen_thc` raises).\n- **10 gates / 5 non-goals**: G1 low-THC/fibre-and-ritual-only · G2 non-recreational (使用罪尊重) · G3 non-adjudicating/political-neutral (no 推進/反対 stance) · G4 member-principal/no-fiat-inflow (okaimono; nusa never licensee/funder; §1.3 preserved) · G5 no-server-key · G6 Murakumo-only · G7 sourcing-honesty · G8 outward-gated · G9 PII-consent · G10 medical-boundary (大麻由来医薬品 → yakushi/iyashi/mitate).\n- **5 cells** (langgraph→WASM, Murakumo-only, `.solve()` raises at R0): `fiber_provenance` (coded — THC-class screen) · `cultivation_license_plan` (coded — member-principal/server-keyless/outward-gated state machine) · `observation_bridge` (coded router → danjo/chigiri/moushibumi/yakushi) · `heritage_ingest` · `rite_supply` (scaffold).\n- **5 lexicons** `com.etzhayyim.nusa.*` + **ontology** `00-contracts/schemas/ritual-hemp-ontology.kotoba.edn` + `:representative` seed `data/seed-ritual-hemp.kotoba.edn` (とちぎしろ low-THC variety, aratae/大嘗祭, 阿波忌部/三木家) + `methods/analyze.py` heritage report.\n- **Direction 2 — extended existing actors (no new political logic)**: **danjo** `methods/v1-jp-seed.json` gained the `cannabis-policy-legislative-trace` methodNote (non-adjudicating, both-views-neutral, datoms-only) + a README scope line; **moushibumi** `registry/targets.seed.json` gained neutral `jp-cannabis-cultivation-law-pubcom` + `jp-cannabis-policy-seigan` participationTargets (G3 — equally open to 賛否, no 推進/反対/GOTV).\n- **Registration**: `actor-profile-seed.kotoba.edn` (actors-v1) + root `CLAUDE.md` Tier-B table + `90-docs/adr/README.edn` + `deps.toml`.\n- **Verification**: **25 tests green** (8 analyze incl. G1 psychoactive-reject + 17 cell state-machine); `analyze.py` runs (THC breakdown `:low-thc 1 / :fiber 2`); danjo `no-danjo-adjudication.mjs` lint **exit 0**; all new EDN parses; danjo + moushibumi seed JSON valid. Suites run with `PYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1` (repo pytest plugin env broken — `pydantic`/`langsmith`).\n\n## NOT done (honest)\n\n- R0 design-only: no live cultivation, no 栽培者免許 filing, no live 法令/heritage ingest, no atproto publish — all Council Lv6+ + operator gated (G8); `.solve()` raises until Council activation.\n- Legal figures (2023 reform, statute references) are `:representative` and require primary-source verification (e-Gov 法令データ提供システム / 官報) before any outward use.\n- Bounded `:representative` heritage seed (3 cultivars / 6 rites / 2 ceremonies / 3 lineage / 2 licence designs); lineage breadth (other 忌部 branches) and additional low-THC landraces not yet enumerated.\n- `heritage_ingest` / `rite_supply` are `.edn`-defined scaffolds, not coded.\n- Worker `INFRA_ACTORS` reflection of nusa (live did.json serving) is a follow-up.\n- **Not committed** at session close (working tree under `orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-nusa/` + `00-contracts/` + `90-docs/adr/` + the modified danjo/moushibumi/CLAUDE.md/deps.toml).\n\n# Consequences\n\nThe monorepo now has a charter-clean, tradition-honest answer to the cannabis question that lands in the institutionally-open low-THC space and structurally refuses the prohibited one. danjo/moushibumi gained a worked cannabis-policy example without any new political-neutrality logic.\n\n# Alternatives Considered\n\nSee ADR-2606039800 §Alternatives (recreational-legalization advocacy actor, cannabis-derived-medicine actor, and a single actor owning the legislative-observation cells — all rejected there).\n\n# References\n\n- ADR-2606039800 — nusa (幣) ritual/industrial hemp heritage + low-THC cultivation Tier-B actor (authoritative design)\n- ADR-2605301600 — danjo (non-adjudicating oversight; extended)\n- ADR-2605312400 — moushibumi (neutral democratic participation; extended)\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2606040000-session-close-nusa-ritual-hemp-actor-and-cannabis-policy-neutral-extensions.edn", :adr/source-repo "root", :adr/topic "session-close-nusa-ritual-hemp", :adr/last_verified "2026-06-04", :adr/date "2026-06-04", :adr/authoritative false, :adr/related ["2605301600" "2605312400"]}]
